<title>USA: Calif. $917 mln cash reserve notes 3.85 pct yield.</title>
<headline>Calif. $917 mln cash reserve notes 3.85 pct yield.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc. said it priced $917 million California cash reserve notes with a coupon of 4 3/4 percent and a yield of 3.85 percent.</p>
<p>The notes are dated 7/2/1997 and due 7/2/1998. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
